道无法呼吸；</p>\n<p>我目前遇到一个棘手的问题，想求助友友们；</p>\n<p>孩子要长期吃靶向药，需要完全自费；</p>\n<p>最近意外得知，可以从成人病友手里购买（成人医保报销，便宜）；</p>\n<p>谁有病友群？能拉我进去~~</p>\n<p>抖音、小红书，翻遍了，没有找到几个微信群；</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789459732, "replies": 114, "id": 1242184}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b6d7/67d2/22_large.png?m=1649080598", "name": "macos", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b6d7/67d2/22_normal.png?m=1649080598", "title": "macOS", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/macos", "topics": 24030, "footer": "<a href=\"/mbp\">MacBook Pro</a> 及 <a href=\"/go/imac\">iMac</a> 等 <a href=\"/go/apple\">Apple</a> 公司设计的计算机所运行的操作系统。<a href=\"/go/idev\">iOS</a> 的基础。", "header": "The world’s most advanced desktop operating system.", "title_alternative": "macOS", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b6d7/67d2/22_mini.png?m=1649080598", "stars": 5492, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 22, "parent_node_name": "os"}, "member": {"id": 628475, "username": "gumgum291", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/gumgum291", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5857/e664/628475_mini.png?m=1763093296", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5857/e664/628475_normal.png?m=1763093296", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5857/e664/628475_large.png?m=1763093296", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5857/e664/628475_xlarge.png?m=1763093296", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5857/e664/628475_xxlarge.png?m=1763093296", "created": 1683781232, "last_modified": 1763093296, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "itisqiang", "last_touched": 1789480067, "title": "有 m4 芯片电脑升级到 macos27 的嘛", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242009", "created": 1789431562, "deleted": 0, "content": "相比 15.7 内存占用会高多少？", "content_rendered": "<p>相比 15.7 内存占用会高多少？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789431562, "replies": 93, "id": 1242009}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https